          ],
          "assets": [],
          "metadata": {
            "skills": [
              "Use the Poisson probability mass function.",
              "Set up and solve an equation from the condition P(X=n)=P(X=n+1).",
              "Compute P(X=12) in terms of e and constants."
            ],
            "methods": [
              "Poisson PMF: P(X=n)=e^{-15}15^n/n!.",
              "Ratio of successive Poisson probabilities to form an equation.",
              "Solve for n and substitute back."
            ],
            "subtopics": [],
            "main_topic": "The Poisson Distribution",
            "metadata_model": "gpt-5.4-nano",
            "question_style": "multi_step_problem",
            "diagram_required": false,
            "difficulty_level": 3,
            "taxonomy_version": "cambridge-maths-v1",
            "calculator_required": null,
            "classification_confidence": 0.88
          },
          "total_marks": 4,
          "stem_markdown": "The random variable \\(X\\) has the distribution \\(\\mathrm{Po}(15)\\).\n\nIt is given that \\(\\text{P}(X = n) = \\text{P}(X = n + 1)\\).",
          "question_number": 3,
          "mark_scheme_items": [
            {
              "mark_code": "B1",
              "part_path": [
                "a"
              ],
              "is_final_answer": true,
              "sequence_number": 1,
              "content_markdown": "$$e^{-15} \\times \\frac{15^{12}}{12!}$$",
              "guidance_markdown": "Seen.",
              "source_page_numbers": [
                10
              ],
              "is_alternative_method": false
            },
            {
              "mark_code": "B1",
              "part_path": [
                "b"
              ],
              "is_final_answer": false,
              "sequence_number": 2,
              "content_markdown": "$$e^{-15} \\times \\frac{15^n}{n!} = e^{-15} \\times \\frac{15^{n+1}}{(n+1)!}$$",
              "guidance_markdown": "If brackets (n+1)! missing allow benefit of doubt.",
              "source_page_numbers": [
                10
              ],
              "is_alternative_method": false
            },
            {
              "mark_code": "M1",
              "part_path": [
                "b"
