          },
          "total_marks": 9,
          "stem_markdown": "The random variable \\(X\\) has probability density function given by\n\n\\[\nf(x)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{kx^2}{a^2} & 0 \\leqslant x \\leqslant a,\\\\\n0 & \\text{otherwise},\n\\end{cases}\n\\]\n\nwhere \\(k\\) and \\(a\\) are positive constants.",
