              "is_final_answer": true,
              "sequence_number": 3,
              "content_markdown": "$$\\Rightarrow \\frac{ka}{3} = 1 \\Rightarrow k = \\frac{3}{a}$$",
              "guidance_markdown": "AG. Must see an intermediate step and answer. Convincingly obtained no errors seen.",
