          "total_marks": 10,
          "stem_markdown": "Birgitte has a six-sided dice. She suspects that the dice is biased so that the probability, \\(p\\), that it will show a six on one throw is less than \\(\\frac{1}{6}\\). She throws the dice 30 times and finds that it shows a six on exactly 2 throws.",
